<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Priest Patricio Alfredo Sánchez Molinari was killed when a wall-mounted crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass in Guayaquil, Ecuador. The church allegedly reinstalled the same cross two days later, prompting the priest's family to demand an inquiry and accusations that the priest had stolen $2 million from worshippers. Critics describe the incident as a leadership failure within the Ecuadorian Catholic hierarchy. The security crisis continues with U.S. forces operating alongside Ecuadorian troops, redeploying MQ-9 Reaper drones for anti-drug operations and imposing curfews, while 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxON0diRWtYOVBGX2ZQZVlER3ZTWkZjYmtYSFAydUs2eFQ1NzM2NWZNRFlSci13Slg1V1VPa1N1YTBUWGZWZG5IbDJkUzgzX3hONm9jUTh2Z1paUWNGOHBzUGhrcXE4UjNOblp4WDlVcVJZLWFqajVLT212WTBNM1F1VHRQSGdGQzhqNUVJbkw0c1Nkc0Vl?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQODBMY056RXdBUUhkeEpSUWZnN1Y4T2lTV3U0RnREeUVSV2taNzVwbjFjbFBYeFBNLXpsRGZlVUhzWHRzS3hyN1dkcnZWZHU5bHE4elJWNXhDV1ZEdmpXdDVRU2NfRnB5QXhZb3hkcmZrU3RqZFRYQ2s5al9XWVYzU1Rma1hCOTVyUHFMRzI2YTdqVGxFTmc4Zy1Zc2tHQzZTZWdzb2VFakhzakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxObS1RRUc3Qmo5WHZhSTVhclVHMzdEVzYwNmphd19GNFVHcGd6UVlmU2tOTDZVdXA2Y0V4MjFPVXRLS0tXQ0ZqeVEtczAwV3dCTUVsVFo2UHVvSWpuVXNoT0k0VzNlcnNDZzg1WW50MXBIaUxnWURacHY2VFNQNFlmckJ3enh0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;inkl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOcm9Xc3RSQzNHcHdybjRrRGhIWVU0WnFHeDVDLWdyd3NlX2ZXTW9lanEwc1dNMjR0bkJyWWhyWVJsVEJLcWUzdHVzUEphVDBtUDJxaWIzZDUtNUdNOHh6NXVtSXMtTHFScDc0SENOLVZGOEFLcUNaNk1